^SAMPLE = GSM5708124
!Sample_title = U937_GC1_A2
!Sample_geo_accession = GSM5708124
!Sample_status = Public on Feb 07 2022
!Sample_submission_date = Nov 29 2021
!Sample_last_update_date = Feb 07 2022
!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = U937
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: U937
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: Acute Myeloid Leukemia
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = genotype/variation: Wild-Type
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = HMECs were treated with no-targeting siRNAs or STAG2 targeting siRNAs. HMECs were transfected with 5uL per 6-well plate of Lipofectamine RNAiMAX transfection reagent and 40nM siRNA duplex (Dharmacon).
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = U937 cells were grown in RPMI+10%FBS+1%P/S/G, HMEC cells were grown in HuMEC media supplemented with HuMEC supplement kit
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = U937 cells Total RNA was purified from 1 million cells using Rneasy plus isolation kit (QIAGEN) following the manufacturer instructions and 1uL of a 1:10 diltion of ERCC Spike-in mix (Thermo Fisher) was added to each sample.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = U937 RNA-Seq libraries were prepared with the TruSeq mRNA kit from Illunima according to the standard protocol.
!Sample_data_processing = For U937 cells, RNA-seq reads were mapped using STAR version 2.4.2a. The STAR genome index was generated from human reference sequence hg19 (FASTA downloaded from UCSC genome browser) and coding transcripts from GENCODE Release 19 (GTF downloaded from http://www.gencodegenes.org/). Reads mapping to genes were quantified with featureCounts from the R package Subread (v2.0.1). Transcripts per million (TPM) were quantified from the count data.
!Sample_data_processing = For HMECs, each RNA-seq sample was aligned to the hg19 genome using STAR version 2.7.0a.
!Sample_data_processing = For HMECs, reads mapping to genes were quantified with featureCounts.
!Sample_data_processing = For HMECs, differential expression was quantified using DESeq2.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg19
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Raw counts matrix, TPM normalized counts matrix, differential expression output
